#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `giving information to the Authority or another person acting under the Act` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `giving information to the Authority or another person acting under the Act` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `leaving information out of what I give to a person acting under the Act` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `failing to appear, answer questions or produce material when a review officer requires it` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `failing to appear, answer questions or produce material when a review officer requires it` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `something else` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 0

