#ASSERT `the days of the period from` (`the date` 1 2 2024) `to` (`the date` 1 3 2024) EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `the days of the period from` (`the date` 2 3 2024) `to` (`the date` 1 3 2024) EQUALS 0
